        <body>
            <div xml:id="d198">

                <pb facs="0296" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg222"/>

                <head>Mr. Van Valkenburgh to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 46.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States in
                                Japan,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Yedo,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-10-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 6, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    copy of a communication from the Gorogio which I received yesterday, announcing
                    the death of the late Tycoon on the 20th day of the 8th month, (September 28th,)
                    and the appointment of Prince Hitotsbasi to be his successor, with the title of
                    Nye Sama, (his majesty.)</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. B. VAN VALKENBURGH.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d198-a1.xml" xpointer="d198-a1"/>
